# Pin the public npm registry explicitly.
#
# A machine-level ~/.npmrc pointing at an internal Microsoft package proxy
# silently rewrites `resolved` URLs (and downgrades `integrity` to sha1) for
# every install, which corrupts this public repository's lockfile provenance
# and breaks `npm ci` for outside contributors. Declaring the registry here
# overrides the user-level setting for anyone installing in this directory.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/